Execute Phase 16 in independent substeps.

16A BACKUPS
Export/import a versioned bundle with metadata and referenced media.
Validate paths, sizes, integrity, and schema.
Metadata JSON alone is not a full backup.

16B TEAMS
Workspace roles and server-side permissions.
Expiring invitations, revocation, comments, review.
Tie approvals to exact content fingerprints.

16C BRAND RECIPES
Reusable fonts, colors, text styles, narration preferences,
approved references, pacing, and intro/outro settings.
Do not leak private media through templates.

16D FORMATS
Add reviewed square/horizontal layouts.
Reframe intentionally; never stretch.
Validate text and product visibility per format.

ACCEPTANCE
Each substep passes its own persistence, authorization,
migration, and real-export checks.

Stop after Phase 16.
